1
00:00:07,132 --> 00:00:08,172
[SNIFFS]

2
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:10,131
(Sheldon:)Smell that?

3
00:00:10,802 --> 00:00:13,432
(Sheldon:)That's the smell of new comic books.

4
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:16,894
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes.

5
00:00:18,309 --> 00:00:19,979
(Howard:)They're on me today, boys.

6
00:00:20,437 --> 00:00:24,147
(Raj:)You're paying?
Have you been selling your sperm again?

7
00:00:24,941 --> 00:00:26,521
(Howard:)No, I'm celebrating.

8
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:30,363
(Howard:)As we speak, the space shuttle is docking
at the Internationale Space Station...

9
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:35,080
(Howard:)...where it will deploy the Wolowitz
Zero-Gravity Waste Disposal System.

10
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:38,123
(Raj:)Oh, get over yourself.
It's a high-tech toilet.

11
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:41,416
(Leonard:)Just think, thanks to your hard work...

12
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:46,883
(Leonard:)...an international crew of astronauts will
boldly go where no man has gone before.

13
00:00:47,297 --> 00:00:49,587
- Is that supposed to be funny?
- I believe it is.

14
00:00:49,758 --> 00:00:52,138
(Sheldon:)The Star Trek reference
and the play on words...

15
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:54,432
...involving the double meaning
of "to go"...

16
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:58,726
...suggest that Leonard is humorously
mocking your efforts in space plumbing.

17
00:00:58,892 --> 00:01:02,022
(Howard:)Okay, make your little jokes.
But of the four of us...

